ll can actually predict the  future or if these quick shots are  visions of what their future may become  we saw similar quick flashes occur with  alma after she took the pill in episode  2 showing her performing on stage with  an insatiable urge to feed belle takes  austin to crystal decanters where the  boys or queens are watching a rupaul  type show and enjoying some pizza and  beer and belle wastes no time shooting  the men and cutting one's throat so that  austin can feed while crystal runs into  the cemetery and who loves this cemetery  well it's our pal the pale man who makes  quick work of poor crystal decanter with  only two episodes left of the first part  of double feature it looks like the next  two episodes will focus back on the  gardner family i'm still hoping that  we'll get a tb karen backstory she and  mickey are probably my two favorite  characters this season and i'm hoping to  come out with an episode 5 preview  breakdown video later this evening so  make sure you're subscribed when that  comes out thanks for watching everyone  be sure to give the video a like and for  more bad takes you can follow me on  twitter and instagram at thinkstoryyt  until next time remember  daddy loves you very much  you

